      <title>NDLW 2026: Visualize Learning: AI-Powered Storytelling with Adobe Firefly </title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54354616093279/huge/df14e60048fe9168cb3dc7375f18338e4840b783.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 02 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Visualize Learning: AI-Powered Storytelling with Adobe Firefly</p>

<p>Turn ideas into compelling visuals and creative digital stories with Adobe Firefly! In this hands-on session, explore how generative AI can enhance online teaching and learning through visual storytelling. Participants will experiment with text-to-image generation, generative fill, and image editing while practicing effective prompting techniques to create customized instructional content.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Session Takeaways</p>

<p>Explore Adobe Firefly's AI-powered image generation and editing features.Craft effective prompts to create and customize visual content.Apply Adobe Firefly to enhance presentations, instructional materials, and interactive learning activities. </p>

<p>Date: Monday, November 2, 2026</p>

<p>Time: 2 pm-3 pm (EST)</p>

<p>Register here: <a href="https://howard.zoom.us/meeting/register/TjjXnToGRq-6xZIpcm0zHw">https://howard.zoom.us/meeting/register/TjjXnToGRq-6xZIpcm0zHw</a></p>

